information from the peer
 * eureka nodes.If for some reason this operation fails, the server does not 
allow the user to get
 * the registry information for a period specified in {@link
 * com.netflix.eureka.EurekaServerConfig#getWaitTimeInMsWhenSyncEmpty()}.
 *
 * <p>One important thing to note about <em>renewals</em>.If the renewal drops 
more than the
 * specified threshold as specified in {@link
